LICENSES FOR THIS REPOSITORY
============================

This repository holds material under two licences. Read part 1 and part 2.
Part 1 is the default. Part 2 names every path that is an exception.

Creative Commons permits mixed licensing inside one work when the marking is
clear. See the Creative Commons FAQ (https://creativecommons.org/faq/) and
"Marking your work with a CC license"
(https://wiki.creativecommons.org/wiki/Marking_your_work_with_a_CC_license).
CC BY 4.0 material can be incorporated into a CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 work. The
reverse is not permitted: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 material cannot be relicensed as
CC BY 4.0.

Credit for every third-party source is in CREDITS.md at the root of this
repository.


